tests/clean-prose/NoForceWords.md:25:1:suggestion:CleanProse.VagueAntecedent:§1: 'It’s' opens on a bare pronoun. Name the noun unless it is the previous sentence's subject. If the sentence only justifies the one before it, cut it per §7 unless §8 keeps the reason.
